<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>arizona</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Luke Chiang, Julles</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">TYPHOON</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3maue0IaPdv2RAqsgQbbzE</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.072" end="00:12.072">It’s been a long time, Arizona</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.439" end="00:18.252">Nothing has changed while I been away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.252" end="00:22.654">My friends all look the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.654" end="00:30.545">Family’s waiting for a photo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.545" end="00:36.836">Here’s where I feel safe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.836" end="00:40.739" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.739" end="00:48.739">How could I ever forget this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.458" end="00:55.650">All that I need I already have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.650" end="01:00.078">When I’m in disarray</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.078" end="01:08.048">However painful the distance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.048" end="01:15.062">You’re what keeps me sane</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.062" end="01:23.062" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.413" end="01:41.418">Whatever time tells</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.418" end="01:46.011">Pieces of myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.011" end="01:52.641">Keep coming back to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.641" end="01:55.893" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.893" end="01:59.963">Whatever time tells</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.963" end="02:04.361">Pieces of myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.361" end="02:11.935">Keep coming back to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.935" end="02:14.375" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.375" end="02:19.518">Whatever pain falls</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.518" end="02:23.408">Seasons of rain or joy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.408" end="02:31.408">I’m coming back to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.147" end="02:36.788" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.788" end="02:44.788">It’s been a long time, Arizona</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.136" end="02:50.136">Don’t you go changing while I’m away</p></div></body></tt>